# to optimized/TurboFan machine code (%GetOptimizationStatus kOptimized bit, NOT
# just WASM — the A.1 "assert real optimization" requirement); (2) NODE_WASM_OK —
# a trivial WebAssembly.Instance executes add(2,3)===5 (the capability the Phase
# 90b yoga.wasm TUI needs); and (3) the kernel logged `[wx] v2-guarded W+X
# mapping (pkey=N)` (V8 took the PKU-guarded path, no unguarded RWX). The JIT
# variant REQUIRES PKU, so the gate runs only under M3OS_KVM=1 on a PKU host
